While in the produce section, click on the profile you like and hit the "+". This creates a custom profile. Set a few things you like and give it a name and description. Then go to C:\Users\username\AppData\Roaming\CyberLink\PowerDirector\9.0 and you will see a Profile.ini file. Edit that file (notepad) and change the video width and video height to your specs for the named profile you created. Use it to produce and see if it works for you.JeffThis message was edited 1 time. Last update was at Jan 19. 2012 22:37Orien Path:C:\Users\Orien Star\AppData\Roaming\CyberLink\PowerDirector\19.0\UserConfigure